@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@email = customer@example.com
@password = Password-1234

### Register; use a new email when running this request again
# @name register
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "confirmPassword": "{{password}}",
  "fullName": "Nguyễn An",
  "phone": "0901234567",
  "dateOfBirth": "2000-01-02"
}

### Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Current account
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Seeded administrator (V3)
# @name adminLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Requires ADMIN + ACCOUNT_READ
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/accounts?page=0&size=20&status=ACTIVE
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Account details; requires ADMIN + ACCOUNT_READ
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/accounts/{{login.response.body.$.data.account.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Public health endpoint
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### List administrator accounts; requires ACCOUNT_READ
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/admin-accounts?page=0&size=20&status=ACTIVE
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Available permissions; copy IDs for role requests
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/permissions
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### List roles; find the ADMIN role ID for administrator requests
# @name roleList
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/roles?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Create a custom role; its code must be unique
# @name createdRole
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Support team","code":"SUPPORT_TEAM","permissionIds":[]}

### Update custom role; copy permission UUIDs from the permission catalog
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/roles/{{createdRole.response.body.$.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Customer support team","permissionIds":[]}

### Create an administrator; replace adminRoleId using roleList response
@adminRoleId = REPLACE_WITH_ADMIN_ROLE_UUID
# @name createdAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/admin-accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"manager@example.com","password":"Password-1234","fullName":"Manager","phone":"0901234567","roleIds":["{{adminRoleId}}"]}

### Administrator details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/admin-accounts/{{createdAdmin.response.body.$.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Update administrator
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/admin-accounts/{{createdAdmin.response.body.$.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"manager@example.com","fullName":"Updated Manager","phone":"0901234567","status":"ACTIVE","roleIds":["{{adminRoleId}}"]}

### Reset administrator password
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/admin-accounts/{{createdAdmin.response.body.$.data.id}}/password
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"password":"Changed-5678"}

### Create guest customer
# @name createdCustomer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"fullName":"Trần Bình","phone":"0912345678","gender":"MALE","dateOfBirth":"1995-05-20","status":"ACTIVE"}

### Search customers
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/customers?page=0&size=20&status=ACTIVE&search=0912345678
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Customer details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/customers/{{createdCustomer.response.body.$.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Update customer; accountId is immutable and not accepted
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/customers/{{createdCustomer.response.body.$.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"fullName":"Trần Bình Updated","phone":"0912345678","gender":"MALE","dateOfBirth":"1995-05-20","status":"ACTIVE"}

### Customer counts by status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/customers/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Customer accounts that can be linked to a new profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/customers/linkable-accounts?search=example.com&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Upload an avatar (multipart); put data.url into avatarUrl
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/uploads/avatars
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=avatar

--avatar
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="avatar.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./avatar.png
--avatar--

### Soft-delete customer profile
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/customers/{{createdCustomer.response.body.$.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Soft-delete administrator account and profile
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/admin-accounts/{{createdAdmin.response.body.$.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Soft-delete unassigned custom role
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/roles/{{createdRole.response.body.$.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Catalog picker options; requires PRODUCT_READ
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/catalog/options
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Create product category; use unique names/codes when repeating this workflow
# @name createdCategory
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Áo thun LemonadeX","parentId":null,"slug":null,"description":"Danh mục áo thun","status":"ACTIVE"}

### Create brand
# @name createdBrand
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/brands
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"LemonadeX Studio","slug":null,"logoUrl":null,"description":null,"status":"ACTIVE"}

### Create color
# @name createdColor
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/colors
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Đỏ","code":"RED","hexCode":"#FF0000","status":"ACTIVE"}

### Create size
# @name createdSize
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/sizes
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"M","code":"M","sortOrder":2,"status":"ACTIVE"}

### Create product with ordered images; the first image is primary
# @name createdProduct
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/products
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productCode":"TEE-001",
  "name":"Áo thun LemonadeX",
  "slug":null,
  "description":"Áo cotton mặc hằng ngày",
  "shortDescription":"Cotton 100%",
  "brandId":"{{createdBrand.response.body.$.data.id}}",
  "categoryId":"{{createdCategory.response.body.$.data.id}}",
  "material":"Cotton",
  "gender":"UNISEX",
  "basePrice":199000,
  "status":"ACTIVE",
  "images":[{"url":"https://example.com/front.png","altText":"Mặt trước"}]
}

### Search/filter products
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/products?page=0&size=20&search=TEE&status=ACTIVE&brandId={{createdBrand.response.body.$.data.id}}&categoryId={{createdCategory.response.body.$.data.id}}&gender=UNISEX
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Product details with variant counts and price range
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/products/{{createdProduct.response.body.$.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Create a variant; null SKU is generated from product/color/size codes
# @name createdVariant
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/product-variants
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId":"{{createdProduct.response.body.$.data.id}}",
  "colorId":"{{createdColor.response.body.$.data.id}}",
  "sizeId":"{{createdSize.response.body.$.data.id}}",
  "sku":null,
  "price":199000,
  "compareAtPrice":249000,
  "status":"ACTIVE"
}

### Create missing combinations; returns [] if the above variant already exists
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/product-variants/bulk
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId":"{{createdProduct.response.body.$.data.id}}",
  "colorIds":["{{createdColor.response.body.$.data.id}}"],
  "sizeIds":["{{createdSize.response.body.$.data.id}}"],
  "price":199000,
  "compareAtPrice":249000,
  "status":"ACTIVE"
}

### Update variant; its product/color/size are immutable
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/product-variants/{{createdVariant.response.body.$.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"sku":"TEE-001-RED-M","price":179000,"compareAtPrice":249000,"status":"ACTIVE"}

### Filter variants by product/color/size
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/product-variants?page=0&size=20&productId={{createdProduct.response.body.$.data.id}}&colorId={{createdColor.response.body.$.data.id}}&sizeId={{createdSize.response.body.$.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Create collection with ordered product IDs
# @name createdCollection
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/collections
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name":"LemonadeX Thu Đông 2026",
  "slug":null,
  "description":"Bộ sưu tập mùa mới",
  "imageUrl":null,
  "startAt":"2026-10-01T00:00:00+07:00",
  "endAt":"2026-12-31T23:59:59+07:00",
  "status":"ACTIVE",
  "productIds":["{{createdProduct.response.body.$.data.id}}"]
}

### Collection details including products in display order
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/collections/{{createdCollection.response.body.$.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Upload a catalog image; put returned data.url into images/logoUrl/imageUrl
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/uploads/images
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=catalog-image

--catalog-image
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="product.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./product.png
--catalog-image--

### Soft-delete collection (keeps its products)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/collections/{{createdCollection.response.body.$.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Soft-delete product together with its variants; frees taxonomy references
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/products/{{createdProduct.response.body.$.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Soft-delete unused color
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/colors/{{createdColor.response.body.$.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Soft-delete unused size
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/sizes/{{createdSize.response.body.$.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Soft-delete unused brand
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/brands/{{createdBrand.response.body.$.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Soft-delete category after products/children are removed
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/categories/{{createdCategory.response.body.$.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Warehouse/order workflow: create NEW catalog fixtures above, and run this section before deleting them
# Existing catalog fixtures must be ACTIVE. Obtain a customer UUID from GET /admin/customers.
@orderCustomerId = REPLACE_WITH_ACTIVE_CUSTOMER_UUID

### Create a warehouse
# @name createdWarehouse
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/warehouses
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Kho TP. Hồ Chí Minh","address":"123 Nguyễn Trãi, TP. Hồ Chí Minh","status":"ACTIVE"}

### Initialize stock for a warehouse/variant; starts at zero
# @name createdStock
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/inventory
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"warehouseId":"{{createdWarehouse.response.body.$.data.id}}","productVariantId":"{{createdVariant.response.body.$.data.id}}"}

### Receive stock; ISSUE uses the same body with transactionType ISSUE
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/inventory/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"warehouseId":"{{createdWarehouse.response.body.$.data.id}}","productVariantId":"{{createdVariant.response.body.$.data.id}}","transactionType":"RECEIPT","quantity":20,"note":"Nhập hàng nhà cung cấp"}

### Warehouse inventory with available/reserved/on-hand quantities
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/inventory?warehouseId={{createdWarehouse.response.body.$.data.id}}&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Record a physical stock count
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/inventory/{{createdStock.response.body.$.data.id}}/adjustments
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"quantityOnHand":19,"reason":"Kiểm kê thực tế"}

### Adjustment history (read-only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/inventory/history?warehouseId={{createdWarehouse.response.body.$.data.id}}&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### All movements, including reservations, shipment issues and returns
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/inventory/transactions?warehouseId={{createdWarehouse.response.body.$.data.id}}&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Create order and atomically reserve stock; prices come from the backend variant
# @name createdOrder
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId":"{{orderCustomerId}}",
  "warehouseId":"{{createdWarehouse.response.body.$.data.id}}",
  "recipientName":"Nguyễn An",
  "recipientPhone":"0901234567",
  "shippingAddress":"123 Nguyễn Trãi, TP. Hồ Chí Minh",
  "note":"Giao giờ hành chính",
  "discountAmount":0,
  "shippingFee":20000,
  "items":[{"productVariantId":"{{createdVariant.response.body.$.data.id}}","quantity":2,"discountAmount":0}]
}

### Search/filter orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/orders?customerId={{orderCustomerId}}&status=PLACED&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Confirm the order
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/orders/{{createdOrder.response.body.$.data.id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"CONFIRMED","note":"Đã xác nhận với khách"}

### Enabled manual payment methods
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/payments/methods
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Create pending payment for the exact order total
# @name createdPayment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"orderId":"{{createdOrder.response.body.$.data.id}}","paymentMethod":"BANK_TRANSFER","amount":{{createdOrder.response.body.$.data.totalAmount}}}

### Record verified payment; no bank/provider is called by this API
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/payments/{{createdPayment.response.body.$.data.id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"PAID","providerTransactionId":null}

### Create shipment for the confirmed order
# @name createdShipment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/shipments
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"orderId":"{{createdOrder.response.body.$.data.id}}","shippingProvider":"Giao hàng nội bộ","trackingCode":null,"shippingFee":20000}

### Dispatch shipment and deduct reserved stock exactly once
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/shipments/{{createdShipment.response.body.$.data.id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"SHIPPED","description":"Đã bàn giao vận chuyển"}

### Record delivery
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/shipments/{{createdShipment.response.body.$.data.id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"DELIVERED","description":"Khách đã nhận hàng"}

### Shipment history across all carriers
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/shipments/history?shipmentId={{createdShipment.response.body.$.data.id}}&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Complete a delivered, fully paid order
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/orders/{{createdOrder.response.body.$.data.id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"COMPLETED","note":"Đơn hoàn tất"}

### Return one purchased item; replacementVariantId is required instead for EXCHANGE
# @name createdReturn
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/returns
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId":"{{createdOrder.response.body.$.data.id}}",
  "requestType":"RETURN",
  "reason":"Khách muốn trả một áo",
  "images":[],
  "items":[{"orderItemId":"{{createdOrder.response.body.$.data.items[0].id}}","quantity":1,"reason":"Không vừa size"}]
}

### Approve the return
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/returns/{{createdReturn.response.body.$.data.id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"APPROVED","note":"Đồng ý nhận hàng trả"}

### Complete after physically receiving the goods; replenishes stock once
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/returns/{{createdReturn.response.body.$.data.id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"COMPLETED","note":"Đã nhận và kiểm tra hàng"}

### Create a pending merchandise refund (shipping fees are excluded)
# @name createdRefund
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/refunds
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"returnRequestId":"{{createdReturn.response.body.$.data.id}}","paymentId":"{{createdPayment.response.body.$.data.id}}","amount":{{createdReturn.response.body.$.data.refundableAmount}},"refundMethod":"BANK_TRANSFER","reason":"Hoàn giá trị hàng trả"}

### Record refund success; no actual bank transfer is executed by this API
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/refunds/{{createdRefund.response.body.$.data.id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"SUCCEEDED"}

### Read order snapshots and aggregate payment/refund totals
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/orders/{{createdOrder.response.body.$.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Order status audit trail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/orders/{{createdOrder.response.body.$.data.id}}/history
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Khách hàng / Marketing: thay các UUID bằng dữ liệu catalog và kho đã tạo
@marketingCustomerId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@marketingProductId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
@marketingVariantId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003
@marketingWarehouseId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004
@marketingOrderItemId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000005
@marketingCouponId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000006
@marketingNotificationId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000007
@marketingInboxId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000008
@marketingReviewId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000009
@customerToken = replace-with-customer-access-token

### Tìm khách hàng / tổng hợp
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/customers?search=An&status=ACTIVE&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Danh sách đánh giá cần duyệt
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/product-reviews?status=PENDING&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Khách gửi đánh giá dòng đã giao (không gửi customerId/productId)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/product-reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"orderItemId":"{{marketingOrderItemId}}","rating":5,"comment":"Vải đẹp, vừa size","images":[]}

### Duyệt đánh giá
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/product-reviews/{{marketingReviewId}}/moderation
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"APPROVED","note":"Đã kiểm tra nội dung"}

### Tạo mã giảm giá (điều chỉnh thời gian trước khi chạy)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/coupons
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"code":"WELCOME10","name":"Ưu đãi khách mới","discountType":"PERCENTAGE","discountValue":10,"maxDiscount":50000,"minimumOrderValue":100000,"usageLimit":100,"usageLimitPerCustomer":1,"startAt":"2026-10-01T00:00:00Z","endAt":"2026-12-31T23:59:59Z","status":"ACTIVE"}

### Lịch sử dùng mã
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/coupons/{{marketingCouponId}}/usages?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Khuyến mãi cho sản phẩm
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/promotions
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Ưu đãi bộ sưu tập","description":"Giảm 15%","promotionType":"PRODUCT_DISCOUNT","discountType":"PERCENTAGE","discountValue":15,"startAt":"2026-10-01T00:00:00Z","endAt":"2026-12-31T23:59:59Z","priority":1,"status":"ACTIVE","productIds":["{{marketingProductId}}"],"categoryIds":[]}

### Flash Sale (giá flash phải thấp hơn giá biến thể hiện tại)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/flash-sales
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Flash Sale tháng 10","startAt":"2026-10-01T00:00:00Z","endAt":"2026-10-31T23:59:59Z","status":"ACTIVE","items":[{"productVariantId":"{{marketingVariantId}}","flashPrice":99000,"quantityLimit":20}]}

### Tạo đơn có ưu đãi tự động và coupon
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerId":"{{marketingCustomerId}}","warehouseId":"{{marketingWarehouseId}}","recipientName":"Nguyễn An","recipientPhone":"0901234567","shippingAddress":"Hồ Chí Minh","discountAmount":0,"shippingFee":20000,"applyMarketing":true,"couponCode":"WELCOME10","items":[{"productVariantId":"{{marketingVariantId}}","quantity":2,"discountAmount":0}]}

### Banner
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/banners
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Bộ sưu tập mới","imageUrl":"https://example.com/banner.jpg","linkUrl":"/products","position":"HOME","sortOrder":0,"status":"ACTIVE"}

### Danh sách banner theo vị trí
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/banners?position=HOME&status=ACTIVE&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Tạo nháp thông báo cho khách đã chọn
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Ưu đãi tháng 10","content":"Bộ sưu tập mới đã ra mắt","notificationType":"PROMOTION","targetType":"SELECTED","customerIds":["{{marketingCustomerId}}"]}

### Phát hành thông báo (gọi lại không gửi trùng)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/notifications/{{marketingNotificationId}}/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Người nhận và trạng thái đọc
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/notifications/{{marketingNotificationId}}/recipients?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Hộp thư khách hàng
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/notifications?read=false&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Đánh dấu đã đọc bằng ID dòng hộp thư
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/notifications/{{marketingInboxId}}/read
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
